    "title": "新增业绩提成规格和绑定员工",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/10b7b455b5e3a611617c7f769268f6f3.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video>\n<strong>新增提成规则</strong></p>\n<p><strong>路径</strong>：【销售】-【业绩提成】-【业绩设置】-【新增规则】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/2548ed176d6411ffcb5093be7c441eb8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>业务场景</strong>：制定业绩提成提成，能够更好的激励员工，提高工作的积极性，为店铺带来更好的效益</p>\n<p>提成规则设定  <strong>————————————————————</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/5368df1a633688552f86c86b3db83874.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>规则名称</strong>：可自定义设定</p>\n<p><strong>提成方式</strong>：可选择【按销售应收】或【按销售实收】或者【销售毛利】两种方式</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/c80a587afc20cefb3b11ee8e4628370e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>分账金额</strong>：可勾选【扣除所含运费】，避免运费参与提成结算</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/777b8f6076a3e35a7849243592a73493.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>计算规则</strong>：\n可选择【统一提成】，即输入固定提成比例（例如：6%）。\n也可选择【阶梯提成】的形式，即区间计算提成（例如：设定业绩5000元以内，提成比例为5%，超出5000元的部分，提成比例为8%）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/9aa05a158f6ad69786071768aba91269.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>超额奖励</strong>：启用后，可设置【超额目标】与【超额奖励】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/6103990fc51ec37d4b22e0b33c92cbfa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>适用员工</strong>：可自行选择适用的员工（可多选）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/bafc0c4346ad755abf07db7a0c5be12e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>临时修改员工绑定提成规则</strong></p>\n<p><strong>路径</strong>：【销售】-【业绩提成】-【业绩设置】-选择加入的提成规则-【修改】-【适用员工】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/ac518bf6123d0a2f2f7b73658a6195eb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n",
